Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||11-05-2001||03:34 PM||||A power drill, a few heavy duty grinding bits, and some elbow grease should be all that you need!  It's really quite easy if you look at what needs to be done.  It's not like port & polishing a head.  Give it a whirl yourself... it'll be the cheapest way (unless you don't own a drill and/or a vice).||||reg||1
